{
  "id": "p38",
  "title": "The Comedy Night at the Bay",
  "titleZh": "海湾边的喜剧之夜",
  "topic": "海湾军事基地关闭与募款喜剧夜",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "The small bay town relies on one military base.",
        "zh": "这座小小的海湾小镇依赖着一处军事基地。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A congressional report says the base will cease all work.",
        "zh": "一份国会报告说，基地将停止一切工作。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Local employees demand a clear plan from the town council soon.",
        "zh": "本地员工要求镇议会尽快拿出一份明确的计划。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My uncle's small firm may reduce its investment in the busy port.",
        "zh": "我叔叔的小公司可能会减少它在繁忙港口的投资。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A quiet volunteer group urges the town to stay hopeful.",
        "zh": "一个安静的志愿者团体敦促小镇保持希望。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A conventional solution seems less likely, yet quiet hope remains.",
        "zh": "一个常规的解决方案似乎不太可能，但希望仍在。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A local agent explains the new safety measure to the crowd.",
        "zh": "一位本地代理人向人群解释了新的安全措施。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The town needs equipment and a firm principle before winter.",
        "zh": "小镇在冬天之前需要装备和一条坚定的原则。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A minor official grants a small sum to our old school.",
        "zh": "一位小官员给我们这所老学校拨了一小笔款。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They compose a short tune for the school show.",
        "zh": "他们为学校演出谱了一首短曲。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My cousin writes a short excerpt about a tired traveller from the north.",
        "zh": "我表姐写了一小段摘录，讲一个来自北方的疲惫旅行者。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A nationalist group disputes the plan at a public meeting.",
        "zh": "一个民族主义团体在公开会议上对这项计划提出异议。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Their anger grips the council, but the mood stays quiet.",
        "zh": "他们的愤怒抓住了议会，但气氛仍然安静。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A confident guide helps the new learners every cold morning.",
        "zh": "一位自信的向导在每个寒冷的早晨帮助新学员。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then their appearance at the meeting ends in loud laughter.",
        "zh": "然后他们出现在会上，最终引来大声的笑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the meeting they respond with an unhappy voice.",
        "zh": "会议期间，他们用不快乐的声音回应。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A vital outcome depends on a clear and simple rule.",
        "zh": "一个至关重要的结果取决于一条清楚而简单的规则。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The burden on rural families grows with each long new week.",
        "zh": "乡下家庭的负担每周都在加重。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A belt of light comedy keeps the crowd awake.",
        "zh": "一点点轻松的喜剧让观众保持清醒。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later a diplomatic team advances the plan and meets every allied group.",
        "zh": "后来一个外交团队推进了计划，并会见了每一个盟方团体。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "An intelligent report notes a growing deficit in the fund.",
        "zh": "一份明智的报告指出基金中不断扩大的赤字。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A dominant firm may slowly weaken the small local market.",
        "zh": "一家占优势的公司可能会慢慢削弱这个小小的本地市场。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sudden crash ends the quiet calm of a warm evening.",
        "zh": "一声突然的撞击结束了温暖夜晚的安静平静。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Nevertheless the first offence occurs near the old wall.",
        "zh": "然而，第一起违法行为发生在旧墙附近。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A bold venture and a local initiative offer every worker a fair chance.",
        "zh": "一项大胆的冒险和一项本地倡议给每个工人一个公平的机会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An efficient team makes a comprehensive review of all the files.",
        "zh": "一个高效的团队对所有文件做了一次全面的审查。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A blast of cold wind may violate the old constitution.",
        "zh": "一阵冷风可能违反那部旧宪法。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My grandfather says their beginning was hard but the town moves ahead.",
        "zh": "我祖父说他们的开始很艰难，但小镇现在向前走。"
      }
    ]
  ],
